<p>Increases local gravity in a radius of 4 for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">4, 5, 6, 7, 8</acronym> turns, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">35, 47, 56, 64, 71</acronym> physical (gravity) damage as well as decreasing the global speed of all affected targets by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">7%, 15%, 20%, 23%, 26%.</acronym></p><p>The damage done will scale with your Spellpower.</p>